cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite NTIA's reference implementation it ports."
type: software
title: "itu-p528: Recommendation ITU-R P.528 for Rust"
abstract: >
  A Rust port of NTIA/ITS's reference implementation of Recommendation ITU-R P.528-5
  (Annex 2, the step-by-step method): basic transmission loss for aeronautical
  paths over a smooth earth, 100 MHz to 30 GHz, including the P.676 gaseous
  absorption and P.835 reference atmosphere it uses. Checked against NTIA's C++.
authors:
